{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adam</strong>, a former special forces operative, is assigned a top-secret mission: investigate a supposedly abandoned underground bio-research facility and extract evidence proving the government\u2019s involvement in funding a viral development program\u2014one that spiraled out of control and killed thousands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What begins as a simple data retrieval job quickly turns into a dangerous search. Most of the facility\u2019s personnel are dead\u2014casualties of brutal emergency protocols. Two scientists are missing, and Adam must track them through dark, hazardous corridors and Stormwater drain tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Adam follows their trail, unsettling signs and unexplained events make him question the true nature of his mission\u2014and his own connection to the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/73728893082ab28336d6c3830b3086b2.poster.avif?t=1753033229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/73728893082ab28336d6c3830b3086b2.webm?t=1753033229\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/extras/73728893082ab28336d6c3830b3086b2.mp4?t=1753033229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game is somewhat similar to:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Evil Within</strong> \u2013 psychological horror and mind exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resident Evil</strong> \u2013 puzzles and atmospheric environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Metro Exodus</strong> \u2013 radiation, underground tunnels, and survival weapons.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Makes This Game Unique?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original ideas\u2014not an imitation of any other game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AI assistance integrated with the main character, set in an ancient fantasy world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning graphics with excellent visual performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse levels that introduce new challenges and enemies, avoiding repetition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breaks the fourth wall, blending the virtual world with reality and engaging players directly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Will You Feel?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience something truly new\u2014like playing a Hideo Kojima game for the first time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Important Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is an <strong>Early Access</strong> version. By purchasing now, you will:<br>\u2714 Enjoy an early experience.<br>\u2714 Save money by receiving the full release for free upon launch.<br>\u2714 Support ongoing development efforts.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2517220?t=1753033229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753033229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753033229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753033229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subt